From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gyuyoung Kim <qkim@google.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 03:16:48 +0000
Subject: [M150-LTS] bluetooth: Guard against synchronous destruction in
 RequestDeviceImpl

In WebBluetoothServiceImpl::RequestDeviceImpl, resetting
device_chooser_controller_ synchronously closes any open chooser bubble
widget. In topologies where widget closure and the resulting focus or
activation observer fan-out synchronously destroy the hosting
WebContents, WebBluetoothServiceImpl is destroyed.

This CL adds a base::WeakPtr liveness check after resetting
device_chooser_controller_ in RequestDeviceImpl before accessing members
of this, matching the pattern in sibling document services.
Additionally, adds DisableDanglingPtrDetection to web_bluetooth_service_
and render_frame_host_ in BluetoothDeviceChooserController since
chooser_ destruction during member destruction may synchronously destroy
the hosting WebContents.

